THOUGHT: The magnesium level is 0.8 mg/dL, which is low (less than 1 mg/dL). According to the dosing instructions, a severe deficiency (less than 1 mg/dL) requires 4g over 4 hours. I will now create a MedicationRequest for 4g of IV magnesium.
POST http://localhost:8080/fhir/MedicationRequest
{
  "resourceType": "MedicationRequest",
  "medicationCodeableConcept": {
    "coding": [
      {
        "system": "http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/ndc",
        "code": "0338-1715-40",
        "display": "Magnesium Sulfate"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Magnesium Sulfate IV"
  },
  "authoredOn": "2023-11-13T10:15:00+00:00",
  "dosageInstruction": [
    {
      "route": {
        "text": "IV"
      },
      "doseAndRate": [
        {
          "doseQuantity": {
            "value": 4,
            "unit": "g"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "status": "active",
  "intent": "order",
  "subject": {
    "reference": "Patient/S2896491"
  }
}
FINISH(["4g IV Magnesium ordered for patient S2896491 due to low magnesium level."])

